<title>BELGIUM: Italy ready to accept 1,000 lira/mark rate in ERM.</title>
<headline>Italy ready to accept 1,000 lira/mark rate in ERM.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy lowered its sights on Sunday in an attempt to gain entry to the European Union's Exchange Rate Mechanism,  but it had still not won agreement from its EU partners, a diplomat said,.</p>
<p>&quot;The Italians are proposing to come down to 1,000 (lira to the German mark),&quot; a diplomat said referring to the central rate at which the lira would enter the EU's currency grid.</p>
</text>
